# Coga's tests, packaging pins and guarded audit rewrites compare exact LF
# bytes, and a wheel built from a CRLF checkout would ship CRLF templates.
# Check every text file out as LF on every platform, including Git for
# Windows with its default core.autocrlf=true.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Shell and PowerShell scripts run on Linux, macOS and Windows hosts; a CRLF
# checkout breaks the shebang (env: 'bash\r').
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
# Git for Windows must not interpret CR-only blank ignore patterns as matches.
.gitignore text eol=lf
